@startuml
title Проведение приема

actor "Врач" as Doctor
boundary "UI" as UI
control "VisitUseCase" as UseCase
entity "AppointmentRepository" as Appointments
entity "VisitRepository" as Visits
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Doctor -> UI: заполняет жалобы, диагноз и рекомендации
UI -> UseCase: CompleteVisit(appointmentId, data)
UseCase -> Appointments: GetByID(appointmentId)
Appointments -> DB: SELECT appointment
DB --> Appointments: appointment
Appointments --> UseCase: appointment
UseCase -> Visits: Save(visit)
Visits -> DB: INSERT visit
DB --> Visits: saved visit
Visits --> UseCase: visit
UseCase -> Appointments: MarkCompleted(appointmentId)
Appointments -> DB: UPDATE appointment status
DB --> Appointments: ok
UseCase --> UI: visit DTO
UI --> Doctor: прием сохранен

@enduml
